<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>04 / 套路层面</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>怎样验证它是否是更科学的刷题方式</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #0E2340', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>三种策略比较：固定套路顺序 / 仅按知识状态推荐 / 顺序与知识状态结合；保持题库、时间、提示权限、批改标准一致</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>套路能力</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>新题独立识别与完成、间隔保持是否提升</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>知识理解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>概念条件与不同情境下的表现，不用套路通过率替代</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>训练效率</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>达到同一目标所需的时间与题量</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>推荐质量</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>前置是否适配、解释是否可核对、是否真正改善学习结果</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：套路层面设计思路.md §7</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 45 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>